WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:07.400
We are part of nature,

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:12.320
and just as we take care of ourselves
we must take care of nature.

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:16.240
To me, nature is magical.

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:17.920
There is nothing like it.

00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:25.000
Travelling and seeing new places
really opens your mind.

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:29.600
I chose to come and do this Erasmus
here in Sicily.

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:33.360
It's one of the best places to work

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:36.520
in the field of environmental control
and education.

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:41.920
The organisation where I have spent my
training period has a principal mission:

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:46.360
the protection, control and monitoring

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:49.120
of the land and sea environments.

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:56.680
My experiences here
have made me stronger,

00:00:56.760 --> 00:01:00.960
able to be more independent,
more flexible,

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:04.960
to work harder than before.

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:07.840
When we go back to our country,

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:10.160
companies will look for people

00:01:10.240 --> 00:01:14.600
who have acquired these kinds of skills,
this flexibility.

00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:21.640
Without the Erasmus programme
I wouldn't have been able to come here.

00:01:24.320 --> 00:01:25.920
No one is going to sort it out for me:

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:29.040
if I don't fight for myself,

00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:32.560
I won't have the future I want.

00:01:32.640 --> 00:01:37.160
It has made me fight for my own dreams!

